{"v":4,"catch":"用槍攻擊他的腹部！","desc":"“SUNSETRIDERS”是1991年由“ KONAMI”發行的動作射擊遊戲。\n遊戲設置於19世紀的美國西部。\n四名槍手將獲得與“SIR RICHARD ROSE”相關的大獎。\n“我們的槍口與我們的嘴一樣多。”\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-06-11","genres":["街機","動作","射擊"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e5ac1595b6b7969ccb889cbf1496fcce22c3df6057e3e04ad8f2bb9fc1dd90f5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c0fc9d3e36278fafaf4ae57b45268928f595b519eee05f99df0d8dc84444eefc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/50dfe81c17442557f9f8e1f3340677fbd4691c6aeaa627cd0c64a083a87a9c30.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f5af6cf4ddae40c7cc1eee982cfaee4d026d4219e1a4ceb5cc8bb5f1fc95360.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dec4f1e813cb1bd82c65bf5e928d7f16fc4c8f161356e2ec67f77d83624976f9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e6588fabcf580a057c85605d47aaeee8019d77bb34b069bb87c625b7f01d1b8c.jpg"],"titleId":"0100d90011534000","dlc":[]}